flowchart TB
    CTS["CTS Spring / document store<br/>Upload the file in CTS. Send the version ID, storage key,<br/>SHA-256, borrower context and Idempotency-Key."]
    API["DPS API - POST /dps/v1/jobs<br/>Validate service access, document and request.<br/>Return a job ID. A repeated request can reuse it."]
    QUEUE["MySQL job queue - CTS target: cov_monitoring<br/>dps_document, dps_job and dps_event_feed.<br/>A worker claims the job under a timed lease."]
    INPUT{"What does<br/>the job read?"}
    CTS --> API --> QUEUE --> INPUT

    INPUT -->|PDF, Office file or image| READ["Read accepted file bytes from CTS storage<br/>Verify hash. Look for a reusable page model by<br/>tenant, source hash, format and pipeline version."]
    INPUT -->|Commentary or document set| MANIFEST["Read a JSON manifest<br/>DRAFT_COMMENTARY or RECONCILE_SET.<br/>These jobs bypass document parsing."]

    READ --> CACHE{"Matching<br/>page model?"}
    CACHE -->|Yes| LOAD["Load the saved page model"]
    CACHE -->|No| PARSE["Isolated parser - Unix socket, no network<br/>Read native text and use OCR where needed.<br/>Large, poorly read or resource-limited jobs can move<br/>to the HEAVY worker and its Docling parser."]
    PARSE --> STORE["Write page-model.json.gz to derived file storage<br/>Page text, numbers, quality and available layout.<br/>MySQL dps_artifact stores the path and hashes."]
    LOAD --> ROUTE{"How is the reading<br/>workflow chosen?"}
    STORE --> ROUTE
    ROUTE -->|AUTO / ONBOARD| CLASSIFY["Classify the page model<br/>Rules score the document type. The small Azure route<br/>can cross-check it. Map the detected type to a pack."]
    ROUTE -->|EXTRACT_*| TYPED["Use the pack named by the job type"]
    ROUTE -->|ANALYZE| ANALYZE["Analyze type, identifiers and legibility<br/>Match identifiers through CTS where available.<br/>Return analysis and mapping signals."]

    CLASSIFY --> PACKS
    TYPED --> PACKS
    PACKS["Document skill packs<br/>Agreement, guarantee, trust deed or restatement → covenants<br/>Sanction letter → sanction · Amendment → amendment_diff<br/>Waiver / consent → waiver · Statement → statement_lines<br/>Compliance certificate → certificate<br/>Agreement, sanction and amendment can also use schedule_terms."]
    MANIFEST --> MANPACKS["Manifest skill packs<br/>commentary drafts from supplied data.<br/>reconcile_set combines earlier reviewed results."]

    PACKS --> RULES["Read with rules first<br/>Find candidate fields and evidence. Select relevant pages.<br/>For agreements, scope AI reads to financial covenants,<br/>undertakings, reporting and events of default."]
    RULES --> SECOND{"Does this workflow use<br/>a model for this read?"}
    SECOND -->|Rules-only, confident skip or AI unavailable| CHECK
    SECOND -->|Yes| PLAN["Build bounded reads using pack prompt and schema<br/>CTS Compose defaults to up to 4 concurrent reads per job.<br/>Reads share a job budget and cancellation checks."]
    PLAN --> AGENT["Azure gateway and Document Agent<br/>strong = extraction · vision = supported image reads<br/>Tool-enabled reads use a fresh CrewAI agent with the<br/>pack's allowed tools. Other readers can call the gateway directly."]
    AGENT -.-> TOOLS["Allowed tools, depending on the skill<br/>Page text, text search, definitions, CTS identifier lookup,<br/>covenant library and formula validation."]
    AGENT --> CHECK["Check and combine findings<br/>Validate JSON, page and quote. Check numeric support.<br/>Repair invalid output once where supported. Discard<br/>unsupported findings and keep review warnings."]
    CHECK --> SAVE
    ANALYZE --> SAVE
    MANPACKS --> SAVE

    SAVE["Persist the result revision and job outcome<br/>MySQL dps_run stores result JSON. dps_event_feed<br/>records updates. Page previews are saved on demand<br/>in derived storage and indexed by dps_artifact."]
    SAVE --> DELIVERY["Spring fetches status, result and page evidence<br/>Poll by job ID or event sequence. Push is optional.<br/>CTS can submit field decisions and close the review."]
    DELIVERY --> REVIEW["Recorded outcome<br/>dps_review_decision preserves field actions.<br/>dps_statement_value stores published statement figures.<br/>CTS applies approved data under its own business rules."]

    API -.-> DEPLOY["CTS Compose reference configuration<br/>2 API replicas · 3 STANDARD workers · 1 HEAVY worker<br/>4 parser sidecars, one per worker."]
    AGENT -.-> GATE["Model controls<br/>Allowed Azure routes, supported text masking, route pause,<br/>token and rate limits. Optional answer cache defaults to off."]
    SAVE -.-> OPS["Support and audit<br/>Job attempts, processing traces, AI usage, tool fingerprints<br/>and audit history stay in DPS. CTS retains its own records."]

